NOTE: This license applies to the original material in this repository - the
documentation, the tools, and the patch data authored for this project.

It does NOT cover the portions of the men's (ATP) patch that reproduce tAz's
English translation "Final Match Tennis (J) TEng v1.2". The published IPS writes
1,294 bytes that are byte-identical to that translation, in the ranges
$1C204-$1C4CE, $1F000-$1F59E, $1F600-$1F79E and $1F800-$1F8DE. That data is tAz's
work, is not original material of this project, and is not offered under the MIT
terms above. See patches/men/README.md for details and verification.

It also does NOT grant any rights to the underlying games "Final Match Tennis" or
"Final Match Tennis Ladies" / "Human Sports Festival", which remain the property
of their respective copyright holders. No playable ROM is included here; the IPS
diffs do contain modified font/tile data derived from those games. You must supply
your own legally-obtained copy of each game to use these patches. This is an
unofficial, non-commercial fan project.
